3.4 Message bus

Run each adapter as a separate process. Kernel communicates via Redis (preferred) or SQLite queue for the demo. Benefits: one adapter crash does not kill the others; restart is independent; per-adapter rate limits are isolated.

Channels: nexus.quotes.{market}, nexus.orders.{market}, nexus.fills.{market}, nexus.health.

