5.1 Perp adapter (perp_binance)

Inherits from NEXUS: live/binance_futures.py, account_validator.py, risk_governor.py logic folded into kernel.

Item Detail
Auth X-MBX-APIKEY header + HMAC-SHA256 signature
Demo endpoint wss://testnet.binancefuture.com/ws-fapi/v1
Order method order.place over WebSocket API; JSON id echoed in response
Rate limit Token bucket, never reuse id before response
Symbols BTCUSDT, ETHUSDT only for demo (limit complexity)
Funding Poll premiumIndex every 60s; feed to risk
Liquidation Poll positionRisk; alert if margin ratio < 0.20

Deliverables for week 1: testnet round-trip order, journal reconciliation, funding watcher.

5.2 Polymarket adapter (polymarket_clob)

Polymarket is event-probability trading, not price-series trading. Strategy inputs are: CLOB midpoint, order book depth, time to resolution, external probability estimate (AI), and liquidity reward score.

Authentication (two layers):

· L1: EIP-712 wallet signature → create_or_derive_api_key() → {api_key, api_secret, api_passphrase}.
· L2: HMAC-SHA256 per request using derived creds. Required for all order create/cancel.

```python
from py_clob_client_v2 import (
    ClobClient, OrderArgs, MarketOrderArgs, OrderType,
    PartialCreateOrderOptions, Side as ClobSide
)

client = ClobClient(host=HOST, chain_id=137, key=PRIVATE_KEY, creds=creds)

def place_limit(token_id: str, price: float, size: float, side: str):
    return client.create_and_post_order(
        order_args=OrderArgs(token_id=token_id, price=price, size=size,
                             side=ClobSide.BUY if side == "BUY" else ClobSide.SELL),
        options=PartialCreateOrderOptions(tick_size="0.01"),
        order_type=OrderType.GTC,
    )
```

Order type Semantics Use in demo
GTC Resting limit until cancelled Default. All quoted orders.
FOK Fill-or-kill (market) Prohibited in demo
FAK Fill-and-kill (market, partial ok) Prohibited in demo
GTD Good-till-date Allowed for event markets with known resolution

v1.0 strategy: passive two-sided market making on 3–5 high-liquidity markets. Quote within 20 bps of midpoint, refresh on midpoint move > 1 cent, cancel on adverse selection. This produces a non-directional P&L stream which is ideal for validating kernel accounting.

Notional conversion: notional_usd = price * size (USDC). The adapter rejects any quote where price < 0.02 or price > 0.98 (near-resolution markets, extreme risk).

5.3 Memecoin adapter (solana_memecoin)

Highest risk. Gated hardest. Never live without the safety filter.

Swap path (Jupiter):

1. GET https://api.jup.ag/swap/v1/quote?inputMint=...&outputMint=...&amount=...&slippageBps=... — or https://lite-api.jup.ag/swap/v1 keyless fallback.
2. POST /swap with userPublicKey and quote response → serialized tx.
3. Add priority fee from getRecentPrioritizationFees (median of recent slots × factor).
4. Sign and send via dedicated RPC (Helius/QuickNode free tier), not public endpoint.

Mandatory safety filter:

```python
# core/data/coinscan.py
THRESHOLDS = {
    "p_rug":            0.15,
    "bundle_pct":       0.40,
    "sniper_pct":       0.30,
    "top10_holder_pct": 0.50,
}

async def safety_scan(mint: str) -> dict:
    scan = await cs.scan(mint)
    reasons = []
    if scan["ai_predictions"]["p_rug"] > THRESHOLDS["p_rug"]:
        reasons.append("p_rug")
    if scan["holders"]["bundle_pct"] > THRESHOLDS["bundle_pct"]:
        reasons.append("bundle")
    if scan["holders"]["sniper_pct"] > THRESHOLDS["sniper_pct"]:
        reasons.append("sniper")
    if not scan.get("lp_lock", {}).get("locked"):
        reasons.append("lp_unlocked")
    if scan.get("flags", {}).get("honeypot"):
        reasons.append("honeypot")
    return {"passed": len(reasons) == 0, "reasons": reasons, "raw": scan}
```

Free-tier constraint: coinscan-sdk free tier ≈ 25 scans/day. Adapter enforces a daily scan counter and refuses to quote beyond it. Budget accordingly: 25 candidate tokens/day maximum during demo.

Hard rules:

Rule Value
Per-trade hard cap $25 (demo)
Daily new positions ≤ 3
Max hold time 30 minutes
Slippage cap 300 bps
Allowed DEX Jupiter only (v1.0)
Forbidden Any token < 24h old, any token without LP lock

Strategy meme_momentum.yaml: safety filter passed + volume spike > 1.5× 20-period average + RSI(7) < 30 on 1m. Exit: stop-loss 2× ATR(1m), take-profit 2R, hard timeout 30 min.

