8. Indicators and Strategies — What to Add, What to Skip

Keep from TONYBOT (7 indicators): RSI, MACD, Bollinger, Supertrend, VWAP, Stochastic, EMA Cross. Do not add more price indicators.

Add — market structure features (per market):

Market Additions
Perp Funding rate Z-score, long/short ratio extremes, liquidation heatmap density
Polymarket Probability velocity (first derivative), book depth, time-to-resolution decay
Memecoin Holder concentration delta, large-holder sell events, LP lock status

Strategies per market (v1.0):

· Perp: existing PERP_PULLBACK and PERP_BREAKOUT from TONYBOT's setup scanner, plus funding_budget guard.
· Polymarket: poly_maker (two-sided quoter) and poly_deviation (AI-assisted).
· Memecoin: meme_momentum (safety + volume + short-term momentum, 30-min max hold).

What NOT to do: do not force one strategy across markets. Microstructure differs fundamentally; a unified strategy will be mediocre everywhere.

