All adapters run dry_run=True. Perps on testnet. Memecoins log proposals only (no execution). Polymarket builds and cancels orders against the real CLOB but with dry_run interception—never submits.

Week 1 — Kernel validation (perp + polymarket)

Day Task Success criteria
